						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;">We are not selling any Class&#x00a0;A ordinary shares under this prospectus and will not receive any of the proceeds from the sale or other disposition of Class&#x00a0;A ordinary shares by the selling shareholders. See the section titled &#x201c;Use of Proceeds&#x201d; appearing elsewhere in this prospectus for more information.</P>
