		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">To our knowledge, as of the date of this prospectus, none of our ordinary shares are held by any record holder in the United&#x00a0;States. None of our shareholders has informed us that it is affiliated with a registered broker<FONT CLASS="nobreak">-dealer</FONT> or is in the business of underwriting securities. As of the date of this prospectus, we are not aware of any arrangement that may, at a subsequent date, result in a change of control of our company.</P>
